<title>INDIA: FII investment permitted in India govt securities - SEBI.</title>
<headline>FII investment permitted in India govt securities - SEBI.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market regulator Securities and Exchange Board of India (SEBI) said on Thursday it has decided to allow foreign institutional investors (FIIs) to invest in dated government securities.</p>
</text>
